      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PURE HELL (1) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (17.78) at this track. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. BAGGY TROUSERS (4) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 365m at Nowra in a quick 20.66 on August 16. Top win latest and can measure up again. TARAWI REX (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Maitland behind Cha Cha Ethics (22.76) in a Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. The form from his last run stacks up well. Hard to beat again. BAD BOY BANJO (2) has strong credentials over this journey.",
